    "headline": "Frost Advisory issued October 18 at 5:56PM PDT until October 19 at 9:00AM PDT by NWS Eureka CA",
    "description": "* WHAT...Temperatures as low as 34 will result in frost formation.\n\n* WHERE...Northern Mendocino Interior, Southern Trinity, and Northern\nLake.\n\n* WHEN...From 2 AM to 9 AM PDT Monday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Frost could harm sensitive outdoor vegetation. Sensitive\noutdoor plants may be killed if left uncovered.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Localized areas may see temperatures more\nbriefly drop to 31",
